lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/RingTheory/Localization/Defs.lean:51:  `GroupTheory.MonoidLocalization`, has `CommRing`, `Algebra R` and `IsLocalization M`
lean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/RingTheory/Localization/Defs.lean:52:  instances if `R` is a ring. `Localization.Away`, `Localization.AtPrime` and `FractionRing`
